q29ujr-mrJsl6bcn0E30HNSquNCCrd1XNAz&__F__=v0fUYvjHMDjRPMSh3tviDHXIoXcPxvDgUUCCPvXMWoX_0JoZLAZABQFzGdi2cn1iU7KJEa5whIrwYtzM-cxLg6GcODciePY-zq5aQcGlmLbSUFLmjwNbDvNYUFCfX81-jKKF7Og39FLdhpZM4ZNQ2HqfoOEskA3iTTt0Dz3knnLqLw7hlM9J2YlFLzYJ-sTnP89BtM4srorE9f_7Ij_dY4Va885CsjIyEFLToLJ5Tc2ZBDuL_zGYL_0-y7zhbVzv6-TN8IvxwdztVcZiYgALoO_QoNhbnJ2DSluVsyW7KaXMfnzAdkln2Ur6Oa9v179uR72CpRZycP0UjO5bN1z2VuL71gXLlOGi7L-7s3oXJC8-gnyqvJQCXcx1E6gUMGGtRRmvo7d6ZXJIjGSKLVVS4pzt7CBAJvB6XTIwOvZNBUrJY5EMtGo2mj1TIDcvazpTbuasaUlaZ7IAePum1TfRrA7HIPg4W4PyrLJQq-URmka4m7iaC9De4N_29zpz5oDwumgSZ3IWs8QGs=" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(34, 81, 255); font-weight: inherit; background: none; text-decoration: underline;" data-link-id="5a6bb630592011f1b192e5e4d28552d1">Tim Fountaine</a></span> explain several ways that companies can build “competitive moats,” including economies of scale, embeddedness in core work, and high-velocity learning and deployment. Of the nine moats the authors describe, leaders can start by focusing on the one to three areas where their companies already have advantages, then committing investments and making hard trade-offs to strengthen them.<br><br><a href="https://email.mckinsey.com/capabilities/quantumblack/our-insights/from-ai-table-stakes-to-ai-advantage-building-competitive-moats?__hScId__=v710000019e67efa8bfbc29776e96c65848&__hRlId__=e8bc20255de04fe70000021ef3a0bce3&__hDId__=e8bc2025-5de0-4fe7-9268-aeba118617bd&__hSD__=d3d3Lm1ja2luc2V5LmNvbQ==&cid=mgp_opr-eml-nsl-omcknsl-mgp-glb--&hlkid=eb23cf9b326341ee9ad8e660ada79d8a&hctky=17208988&hdpid=e8bc2025-5de0-4fe7-9268-aeba118617bd" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: inherit; background: none; text-decoration: none;" data-link-id="f2e9db509af611f082d9e790a986f638"><strong><span style="line-height: 150%;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 150%;"><span style="color: rgb(34, 81, 255); line-height: 150%; text-decoration: underline;">Build a lasting AI edge</span></span><img src="https://images.harmony.epsilon.com/ContentHandler/images?id=cd761513-936e-4a05-8196-6fb668e6a87c" width="20" alt="" data-mce-src="https://images.harmony.epsilon.com/ContentHandler/images?id=cd761513-936e-4a05-8196-6fb668e6a87c"></span></strong></a></span></p></td> </tr> </tbody></table> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </div> </section> <!-- End 1-008: Paragraph | P1 --> </td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF"><!-- Start 1-001: Divider -->
